{"schema":"SDW_SCRIPTURE_CHAPTER_V1","revision":"52add6f41edc5dd9c21f65f02f933fbd1cec266285bee8bce249607475050398","canonicalSourceHash":"f9dfbce6dd2edfe4bb3b4690acd6622f392035be2b0349df98f3607f0a05f6c2","bookId":"engwebu:psa","chapter":48,"verses":[{"translation_id":"engwebu","book_id":"engwebu:psa","chapter":48,"verse_ordinal":696,"verse_start":1,"verse_end":1,"verse_label":"1","text":"Great is the LORD, and greatly to be praised, in the city of our God, in his holy mountain.","is_omitted":0,"source_line":2420},{"translation_id":"engwebu","book_id":"engwebu:psa","chapter":48,"verse_ordinal":697,"verse_start":2,"verse_end":2,"verse_label":"2","text":"Beautiful in elevation, the joy of the whole earth, is Mount Zion, on the north sides, the city of the great King.","is_omitted":0,"source_line":2423},{"translation_id":"engwebu","book_id":"engwebu:psa","chapter":48,"verse_ordinal":698,"verse_start":3,"verse_end":3,"verse_label":"3","text":"God has shown himself in her citadels as a refuge.","is_omitted":0,"source_line":2427},{"translation_id":"engwebu","book_id":"engwebu:psa","chapter":48,"verse_ordinal":699,"verse_start":4,"verse_end":4,"verse_label":"4","text":"For, behold, the kings assembled themselves, they passed by together.","is_omitted":0,"source_line":2429},{"translation_id":"engwebu","book_id":"engwebu:psa","chapter":48,"verse_ordinal":700,"verse_start":5,"verse_end":5,"verse_label":"5","text":"They saw it, then they were amazed. They were dismayed. They hurried away.","is_omitted":0,"source_line":2432},{"translation_id":"engwebu","book_id":"engwebu:psa","chapter":48,"verse_ordinal":701,"verse_start":6,"verse_end":6,"verse_label":"6","text":"Trembling took hold of them there, pain, as of a woman in travail.","is_omitted":0,"source_line":2436},{"translation_id":"engwebu","book_id":"engwebu:psa","chapter":48,"verse_ordinal":702,"verse_start":7,"verse_end":7,"verse_label":"7","text":"With the east wind, you break the ships of Tarshish.","is_omitted":0,"source_line":2439},{"translation_id":"engwebu","book_id":"engwebu:psa","chapter":48,"verse_ordinal":703,"verse_start":8,"verse_end":8,"verse_label":"8","text":"As we have heard, so we have seen, in the city of the LORD of Armies, in the city of our God. God will establish it forever. Selah.","is_omitted":0,"source_line":2441},{"translation_id":"engwebu","book_id":"engwebu:psa","chapter":48,"verse_ordinal":704,"verse_start":9,"verse_end":9,"verse_label":"9","text":"We have thought about your loving kindness, God, in the middle of your temple.","is_omitted":0,"source_line":2445},{"translation_id":"engwebu","book_id":"engwebu:psa","chapter":48,"verse_ordinal":705,"verse_start":10,"verse_end":10,"verse_label":"10","text":"As is your name, God, so is your praise to the ends of the earth. Your right hand is full of righteousness.","is_omitted":0,"source_line":2448},{"translation_id":"engwebu","book_id":"engwebu:psa","chapter":48,"verse_ordinal":706,"verse_start":11,"verse_end":11,"verse_label":"11","text":"Let Mount Zion be glad! Let the daughters of Judah rejoice because of your judgments.","is_omitted":0,"source_line":2452},{"translation_id":"engwebu","book_id":"engwebu:psa","chapter":48,"verse_ordinal":707,"verse_start":12,"verse_end":12,"verse_label":"12","text":"Walk about Zion, and go around her. Number its towers.","is_omitted":0,"source_line":2455},{"translation_id":"engwebu","book_id":"engwebu:psa","chapter":48,"verse_ordinal":708,"verse_start":13,"verse_end":13,"verse_label":"13","text":"Notice her bulwarks. Consider her palaces, that you may tell it to the next generation.","is_omitted":0,"source_line":2458},{"translation_id":"engwebu","book_id":"engwebu:psa","chapter":48,"verse_ordinal":709,"verse_start":14,"verse_end":14,"verse_label":"14","text":"For this God is our God forever and ever. He will be our guide even to death.","is_omitted":0,"source_line":2462}]}